    {
      "source": "The supplied annotations will be considered to be both <em>present</em>\nand <em>directly present</em> with regard to the results returned from\nmethods such as <a href=\"#getAnnotation(java.lang.Class)\"><code>getAnnotation(Class)</code></a>,\n<a href=\"#getDeclaredAnnotation(java.lang.Class)\"><code>getDeclaredAnnotation(Class)</code></a>, etc.",
      "translation": "提供的注解将被视为在从诸如 `<a href=\"#getAnnotation(java.lang.Class)\"><code>getAnnotation(Class)</code></a>`、`<a href=\"#getDeclaredAnnotation(java.lang.Class)\"><code>getDeclaredAnnotation(Class)</code></a>` 等方法返回的结果中，既 `<em>存在</em>` 又 `<em>直接存在</em>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the supplied annotations array is either <code>null</code> or empty, this\nfactory method will return an <a href=\"#isEmpty()\">empty</a> adapter.",
      "translation": "如果提供的注解数组为 `<code>null</code>` 或为空，此工厂方法将返回一个<a href=\"#isEmpty()\">空</a>适配器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
